TEXT 64 32 Left 3 ;Figure 4 - PTM65 adaptation / HSPICE is final simulator
TEXT 1456 640 Left 2 ;Model: supplied 65nm.pm (unchanged).
TEXT 1456 688 Left 2 ;Dimensions: sizing.inc; starts at paper dimensions.
TEXT 1456 736 Left 2 ;VSUP=1.1 V, VCM=0.65 V are chosen assumptions.
TEXT 1456 784 Left 2 ;100 MHz, 20 ps edges, 5 fF per output.
TEXT 1456 832 Left 2 ;CLK low: reset both outputs high.
TEXT 1456 880 Left 2 ;CLK high: compare, then regenerate.
TEXT 1456 928 Left 2 ;Source-body connections follow Figure 4.
TEXT 64 1424 Left 2 !.include "65nm.pm"
TEXT 64 1472 Left 2 !.include "settings.inc"
TEXT 64 1520 Left 2 !.include "sizing.inc"
TEXT 64 1568 Left 2 !.temp 27
TEXT 64 1648 Left 2 !VCLK clk 0 PULSE(0 {VSUP} 2n {TRISE} {TFALL} {TPER/2-TRISE} {TPER})\nVINP vinp 0 PWL(0 {VCM+VDIFF} 20n {VCM+VDIFF} 20.1n {VCM-VDIFF}\n+ 40n {VCM-VDIFF} 40.1n {VCM+VDIFF} 60n {VCM+VDIFF}\n+ 60.1n {VCM-VDIFF} 80n {VCM-VDIFF})\nVINN vinn 0 {VCM}\nVREFP vrefp 0 {VCM}\nVREFN vrefn 0 {VCM}
TEXT 64 1940 Left 2 !.tran 0 80n 0 1p
TEXT 64 1988 Left 2 !.options plotwinsize=0
TEXT 64 2040 Left 2 ;Use 01_functional.sp in HSPICE for authoritative measurements.
TEXT 64 2090 Left 2 ;LTspice uses its own BSIM implementation: results may differ from HSPICE.
